tential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le06ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Phrasal Verbs about Phone Communication"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. Some phrasal verbs are unique to communication on the phone. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the following list of phrasal verbs. Try to use some of these the next time you're on the phone."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call up/ring up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call and  try to reach someone on the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to succeed in speaking to someone on the telephone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to set up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to arrange another call or videochat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wait for a short time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to connect a caller to someone in the office\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to pick up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to answer a phone call\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak louder into the phone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to hang up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to end a conversation and put down the phone or pushing \u201cend\u201d on the phone.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to interrupt a phone conversation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to call someone again or in return\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to break up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" when the other person's voice is unclear and you can't hear them well\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you please put me through to the manager?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you please speak up? I can't hear you well."}, {"type": "example", "content": "When is the best time to call back?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I hate salespeople who ring up like that."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could we set up a videochat later?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Changing Topics on the Phone"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use expressions to redirect a phone conversation when it is not the right time to continue or it's not someone you wish to talk to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "To let the caller know that today is not a good time for a phone conversation, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Oh, this isn't really a good day.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To let the caller know that you're very busy at the moment, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry I'm pretty tied up right now.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To let the caller know that perhaps another time later would be better, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Maybe another time.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To let the person know that there is something they might be interested in, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Actually, we're running a special discount campaign right now. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To let the caller know that it isn't possible to talk right now, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I really can't speak to you right now. We're terribly busy. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To apologize that you must end the conversation, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm sorry. I must go.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To thank the caller quickly for the information and then end the phone call, you use:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Thanks so much. I've got to go.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to demonstrate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to physically show how something is done"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was wondering if I could demonstrate our new kitchen equipment to you. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about work over the phone."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tied up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " busy, occupied"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm pretty tied up right now, 